          "Notice carefully why indirect probes dramatically crush false-positive death declarations without needing tiny brittle timeouts: assuming independent link failure probability p = 0.05, direct probe + k=3 relays drops single-round false failures from 5% down to 0.05^4 = 0.00000625!",
