          "Limiting piggybacked entries per packet via `pop_batch(max_items=3)` bounds MTU frame size reliably so gossip headers never trigger IP fragmentation drops. Over time, `mult * log2(N)` gossip transmissions infect virtually 100% of a cluster with high mathematical probability.",
