          "Analyzing `PiggybackBuffer` reveals why SWIM piggybacking needs zero dedicated multicast transport: health dissemination rides entirely for free on routine liveness packets already crossing the ring. Piggybacking compact membership state diffs onto routine ping and ack packets eliminates noisy separate gossip broadcast channels across healthy clusters cleanly. Prioritizing newly minted state updates via bounded retransmission limits ensures fresh crash alerts spread log-fast while stale repetitive rumors drop gracefully without saturating socket queues cleanly. Bounding dissemination counts deterministically prevents infinite chatter loops while preserving eventual gossip delivery guarantees even during simultaneous multi-rack restarts. Piggybacking compact cluster diffs directly inside routine probe responses halves total health packet counts by eliminating standalone gossip daemon loops safely. Bounded dissemination counters ensure fresh alerts infect every peer cleanly before aging out deterministically without infinite background chatter cleanly. Prioritizing unacknowledged newest member updates speeds rapid ring convergence when multiple workers restart together. Attaching compact change logs onto routine ping and acknowledgment traffic cuts aggregate control-plane socket volume sharply under high cluster churn cleanly. Prioritizing newly minted state transitions via strict retransmission bounds guarantees swift infection across active workers while letting ancient gossip fade deterministically. Bounded metadata piggybacking scales calmly during synchronized auto-scaling bursts without drowning monitoring NIC interfaces cleanly. Capping per-update retransmission budgets inside routine heartbeat frames spreads cluster health transitions smoothly without waking background broadcast storms cleanly safely. Pruning retired updates keeps packet sizes small.",
