          "In-memory saga loops lose track of committed steps immediately if the orchestrator container crashes right after `T2` succeeds. Rebooting without persistent progress logs leaves `T1` and `T2` dangling forever as zombie reservations tying up customer funds and warehouse stock. `DurableSagaOrchestrator` eliminates lost-progress risks by persisting every state change to a durable log before triggering external side effects.",
