          "Combining durable checkpoints in `DurableSagaOrchestrator` with step timeouts prevents stalled workflows from locking customer accounts indefinitely. If `T2` hangs across an unresponsive downstream gateway, timeout policies transition the saga deterministically into `COMPENSATING` state, triggering `C1` cleanly. Every step requires explicit deadline governance so partial network blackholes convert into clean bounded outcomes.",
