        "code": "def quorum_latency_ms(replica_rtts, w, r):\n    # Parallel broadcast completes once w-th (or r-th) fastest healthy node responds!\n    healthy = sorted(rtt for rtt in replica_rtts if rtt is not None)\n    write_ms = healthy[w - 1] if len(healthy) >= w else None\n    read_ms = healthy[r - 1] if len(healthy) >= r else None\n    return {\"write_ms\": write_ms, \"read_ms\": read_ms}\n\n# Replica RTTs with one straggler node hitting 180ms GC pause:\nrtts = [2.1, 3.4, 180.0]\nfor name, (w, r) in [(\"QUORUM(2,2)\", (2, 2)), (\"FAST_WRITE(1,3)\", (1, 3)), (\"ALL_WRITE(3,1)\", (3, 1))]:\n    print(name, quorum_latency_ms(rtts, w, r))",
