          "Watch this critical Tombstone Purging Hazard during compaction: you can ONLY safely discard a `__TOMBSTONE__` during compaction into the **BOTTOMMOST** level (or when guaranteed zero older files exist beneath it)! Dropping a tombstone early during an L1-only compaction exposes ancient live rows waiting in L3 as zombie records!",
