          "Validating `ShardHealthTelemetry.is_healthy_and_free` across healthy, saturated-inflight, high-latency, and tripped-breaker profiles grounds dynamic router failover strictly in verifiable real-time shard capacity rather than fragile static server lists. Feeding live inflight depth, latency ratios, and half-open circuit breaker status straight into shard selection avoids routing new calls toward silently browning-out backend instances cleanly. Live shard utilization telemetry keeps gateway routers agile during brownouts without relying on rigid manual health toggles cleanly. Live shard capacity signals guide edge routers smoothly past sluggish compacting storage nodes without rigid manual host lists.",
